                                                "sense_id": "ab6151fa-0cab-3949-a30d-3cce30abf31c",
                                                "text": "One could imagine, for example, that an occurrent belief (e.g. that I'm allergic to apples) would trigger a dispositional desire (not to get an allergic crisis)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59410395-e9e3-4a5b-acce-9ebf2efdfe39",
                                                "sense_id": "ab6151fa-0cab-3949-a30d-3cce30abf31c",
                                                "text": "In such a case, my belief that the person I will meet is named Robert Barchi is clearly occurrent."
                                            }
